    "content_tag_ids": [],
    "label_names": [],
    "body": "<p>Learn how to sync Shopify segments to Klaviyo. Shopify customers can sync segments built in Shopify to Klaviyo as lists. These lists:</p><ul>\n<li>Reflect a point in time sync from Shopify to Klaviyo.</li>\n<li>Do not update as segment membership changes in Shopify, or if segments are deleted.</li>\n<li>Do not sync members from Klaviyo to Shopify.</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"h_01JYS6EJJ4RB5FDEV9RFM07VR1\">Before you begin</h2><p>Before you can sync segments from Shopify to Klaviyo, you’ll need to:</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005080407\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Integrate Klaviyo with Shopify</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4425956184731#h_01J6F7TREZM0NY2336G80MJFM3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Enable Klaviyo’s app embed in Shopify</a></li>\n</ul><p>Segments will sync to the Klaviyo account that your Klaviyo app embed is connected to in Shopify.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JYS6ERMWF4JD2ARA9XFF7XPN\">Sync a segment</h2><p>To sync a segment from Shopify to Klaviyo:</p><ol>\n<li>In your Shopify admin, navigate to <strong>Customers &gt; Segments</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select the segment you want to use from the list.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Use segment</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Klaviyo</strong>.<br><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 1354/544; width: 81.43%;\" class=\"wysiwyg-image-resized\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/38417065572891\" width=\"1354\" height=\"544\">\n</li>\n<li>Review the popup that appears and click <strong>Create list</strong>.<br><img style=\"aspect-ratio: 1558/488; width: 81.58%;\" class=\"wysiwyg-image-resized\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/38417065573403\" width=\"1558\" height=\"488\">\n</li>\n<li>You’ll be redirected to the new list in Klaviyo. List membership may take some time to sync. </li>\n</ol><p>Repeat the process above to sync additional segments.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JYS6F489NZMX0W5PDD2RMSBS\">Additional resources</h2><p><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005061447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understanding the difference between segments and lists</a></p><p><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005080407\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Getting started with Shopify</a></p>",
